sequenceDiagram
    actor H as Hasta (Tarayıcı)
    participant C as PatientBookingController
    participant S as BookingService (@Transactional)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 17
    participant D as Appointment & ServiceSnapshot

    H->>C: POST /patient/book (CSRF + ROLE_PATIENT)
    C->>S: bookAppointment(BookingCommand)
    S->>S: SecurityContextFacade + Hasta Kimlik Doğrulama
    S->>DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE (patient_profile)
    S->>DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE (staff_profile)
    S->>DB: Şube, Hizmet, Atama, Yetkinlik ve Mesai Kontrolü
    S->>S: IANA Saat Dilimi & DST Boşluk/Çakışma Doğrulaması
    S->>DB: findOverlappingAppointmentsForStaff([start, end))
    S->>DB: findOverlappingAppointmentsForPatient([start, end))
    alt Çakışma Var
        S-->>C: AppointmentConflictException / PatientOverlapException
        C-->>H: HTTP 409 / Kullanıcı Dostu Hata Mesajı
    else Çakışma Yok
        S->>D: branchService.toSnapshot() + Appointment.create(PENDING)
        S->>DB: INSERT appointment + appointment_status_history (null -> PENDING)
        DB-->>S: COMMIT
        S-->>C: Appointment (PENDING)
        C-->>H: Redirect /patient/appointments
    end
